  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**MasterCard 2-series(2221–2720) BIN이 누락되어 브랜드 판별이 틀립니다.**\n\nLine 15~16 로직은 51~55만 처리해서, 유효한 MasterCard(2221~2720)를 `null`로 분류합니다.  \n \n\n<details>\n<summary>변경 제안</summary>\n\n```diff\n   const getBrandName = (cardNumbers: string[]): 'visa' | 'masterCard' | null => {\n-    const fullNumber = cardNumbers.map((chunk) => chunk.padEnd(4, '#')).join('');\n+    const fullNumber = cardNumbers.join('');\n \n     if (fullNumber.startsWith('4')) return 'visa';\n \n-    const prefix = Number(fullNumber.slice(0, 2));\n-    if (prefix >= 51 && prefix <= 55) return 'masterCard';\n+    const firstTwo = Number(fullNumber.slice(0, 2));\n+    const firstFour = Number(fullNumber.slice(0, 4));\n+    if ((firstTwo >= 51 && firstTwo <= 55) || (firstFour >= 2221 && firstFour <= 2720)) {\n+      return 'masterCard';\n+    }\n \n     return null;\n   };\n```\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn\n`@src/feature/CardRegister/components/CardPreviewSection/CardPreviewContainer/CardPreviewContainer.tsx`\naround lines 15 - 16, The current brand detection in CardPreviewContainer uses\nprefix = Number(fullNumber.slice(0, 2)) and only checks 51–55, so MasterCard\n2-series (2221–2720) are missed; modify the logic to also parse the first 4\ndigits (e.g., const prefix4 = Number(fullNumber.slice(0,4))) and add a check\nthat returns 'masterCard' when prefix4 is between 2221 and 2720 (in addition to\nthe existing 51–55 check on prefix), ensuring you evaluate the 4-digit range\nbefore or alongside the 2-digit check using the fullNumber and prefix/prefix4\nvariables.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:adf1764e-409c-468f-ae57-656de94d9e25 -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
